                        "employee-overview"
                    ]
                },
                "description": "Single composite endpoint for the employee profile screen (About / Work / Doc tabs).\n\nAuth:\n- Allowed roles: admin, hr, manager, employee\n- Admin/HR can fetch any user in the same org by userId.\n- Manager/Employee can only fetch their own profile (userId must equal their id).\n\nResponse structure:\n{\n  \"message\": \"Employee overview retrieved successfully\",\n  \"data\": {\n    \"about\": { /* personal + contact info */ },\n    \"work\": { /* job details, reporting manager, team, work location */ },\n    \"documents\": { /* recent documents list */ }\n  }\n}"
            }
